ut much distress","value":"D"}],"options_fa":[{"label":"بسیار سخت","value":"A"},{"label":"نسبتاً سخت","value":"B"},{"label":"ناراحت‌کننده، اما قابل مدیریت","value":"C"},{"label":"قابل مدیریت، بدون فشار روانی زیاد","value":"D"}],"options_fr":[{"label":"Très difficile","value":"A"},{"label":"Assez difficile","value":"B"},{"label":"Inconfortable, mais gérable","value":"C"},{"label":"Gérable sans trop de détresse","value":"D"}],"prompt_en":"Imagine your investment portfolio falls 20% over several months. Your goal, planned investment period, and finances have not changed. How difficult would it be for you to live with that loss?","prompt_fa":"فرض کن سبد سرمایه‌گذاری‌ات طی چند ماه ۲۰٪ افت کند. هدف، مدت زمانی که قصد داری سرمایه‌گذاری کنی و شرایط مالی‌ات تغییر نکرده‌اند. کنار آمدن با این زیان برایت چقدر سخت خواهد بود؟","prompt_fr":"Imaginez que votre portefeuille de placements baisse de 20 % en quelques mois. Votre objectif, votre période prévue de placement et votre situation financière n’ont pas changé. À quel point serait-il difficile pour vous de vivre avec cette perte ?","question_id":"RT03","question_type":"single_choice","score_direction":"direct","scoring":{"A":0,"B":33,"C":67,"D":100},"section":"risk_tolerance","sort_order":2,"version":"v1.10-cognitive-candidate","weight":"1"},{"active":true,"construct":"uncertainty_volatility","construct_role":"primary","options":[{"label":"Not comfortable","value":"A"},{"label":"Slightly comfortable","value":"B"},{"label":"Fairly comfortable","value":"C"},{"label":"Very comfortable","value":"D"}],"options_fa":[{"label":"راحت نیستم","value":"A"},{"label":"کمی راحتم","value":"B"},{"label":"نسبتاً راحتم","value":"C"},{"label":"بسیار راحتم","value":"D"}],"options_fr":[{"label":"Pas à l’aise","value":"A"},{"label":"Un peu à l’aise","value":"B"},{"label":"Assez à l’aise","value":"C"},{"label":"Très à l’aise","value":"D"}],"prompt_en":"Suppose a diversified portfolio could be worth about 15% more or 15% less a year from now, and outcomes outside that range are also possible. How comfortable would you feel holding it?","prompt_fa":"فرض کن ارزش یک سبد متنوع تا سال آینده ممکن است حدود ۱۵٪ بالاتر یا پایین‌تر باشد؛ نتایج خارج از این بازه هم ممکن است. با نگهداری آن چقدر راحتی؟","prompt_fr":"Un portefeuille diversifié pourrait valoir environ 15 % de plus ou de moins dans un an, avec des résultats possibles au-delà de cette fourchette. Seriez-vous à l’aise de le détenir ?","question_id":"RT05","question_type":"single_choice","score_direction":"direct","scoring":{"A":0,"B":33,"C":67,"D":100},"section":"risk_tolerance","sort_order":3,"version":"v1.10-cognitive-candidate","weight":"1"},{"active":true,"construct":"risk_emotion","construct_role":"primary","options":[{"label":"Very uneasy","value":"A"},{"label":"Somewhat uneasy","value":"B"},{"label":"Only slightly uneasy","value":"C"},{"label":"Comfortable accepting that possibility","value":"D"}],"options_fa":[{"label":"خیلی مضطرب و ناراحت","value":"A"},{"label":"تا حدی مضطرب","value":"B"},{"label":"فقط کمی ناراحت","value":"C"},{"label":"با پذیرفتن این احتمال راحت هستم","value":"D"}],"options_fr":[{"label":"Très mal à l’aise","value":"A"},{"label":"Plutôt mal à l’aise","value":"B"},{"label":"Seulement un peu mal à l’aise","value":"C"},{"label":"À l’aise d’accepter cette possibilité","value":"D"}],"prompt_en":"Before investing, knowing the value could fall about 20% for a period of time would make me feel:","prompt_fa":"پیش از سرمایه‌گذاری، دانستن اینکه ارزش سرمایه ممکن است برای مدتی حدود ۲۰٪ افت کند، باعث می‌شود احساس کنم:","prompt_fr":"Avant d’investir, savoir que la valeur pourrait baisser d’environ 20 % pendant un certain temps me ferait sentir :","question_id":"RT07","question_type":"single_choice","score_direction":"direct","scoring":{"A":0,"B":33,"C":67,"D":100},"section":"risk_tolerance","sort_order":4,"version":"v1.10-cognitive-candidate","weight":"1"},{"active":true,"construct":"crash_resilience","construct_role":"primary","options":[{"label":"Move 