 با پتانسیل رشد کمتر","value":"A"},{"label":"احتمالاً سبد باثبات‌تر","value":"B"},{"label":"احتمالاً سبد با رشد بالاتر، با پذیرش نوسان‌های بیشتر","value":"C"},{"label":"قطعاً سبد با رشد بالاتر، با پذیرش نوسان‌های بسیار بیشتر","value":"D"}],"options_fr":[{"label":"Certainement le portefeuille plus stable, même avec un potentiel de croissance plus faible","value":"A"},{"label":"Probablement le portefeuille plus stable","value":"B"},{"label":"Probablement le portefeuille à plus forte croissance, en acceptant de plus grandes variations","value":"C"},{"label":"Certainement le portefeuille à plus forte croissance, en acceptant des variations beaucoup plus importantes","value":"D"}],"prompt_en":"If two long-term portfolios differed mainly in price swings and growth potential, which would you lean toward?","prompt_fa":"اگر تفاوت اصلی دو سبد بلندمدت در میزان نوسان قیمت و پتانسیل رشدشان باشد، بیشتر به کدام سمت متمایل می‌شوی؟","prompt_fr":"Si deux portefeuilles à long terme différaient surtout par l’ampleur de leurs variations de prix et leur potentiel de croissance, vers lequel pencheriez-vous ?","question_id":"RT02","question_type":"single_choice","score_direction":"direct","scoring":{"A":0,"B":33,"C":67,"D":100},"section":"risk_tolerance","sort_order":6,"version":"v1.10-cognitive-candidate","weight":"1"},{"active":true,"construct":"loss_tolerance","construct_role":"consistency","options":[{"label":"A decline of less than 10%","value":"A"},{"label":"A decline of 10% to less than 20%","value":"B"},{"label":"A decline of 20% to less than 30%","value":"C"},{"label":"A decline of 30% or more","value":"D"}],"options_fa":[{"label":"افت کمتر از ۱۰٪","value":"A"},{"label":"افت از ۱۰٪ تا کمتر از ۲۰٪","value":"B"},{"label":"افت از ۲۰٪ تا کمتر از ۳۰٪","value":"C"},{"label":"افت ۳۰٪ یا بیشتر","value":"D"}],"options_fr":[{"label":"Une baisse de moins de 10 %","value":"A"},{"label":"De 10 % à moins de 20 %","value":"B"},{"label":"De 20 % à moins de 30 %","value":"C"},{"label":"De 30 % ou plus","value":"D"}],"prompt_en":"For a diversified portfolio intended for at least five years, what size of decline would first feel too large for you to accept emotionally, even if you did not need to withdraw the money? Recovery is not guaranteed.","prompt_fa":"برای سبد متنوع با افق دست‌کم پنج سال، چه اندازه افت برایت از نظر احساسی غیرقابل‌تحمل می‌شود، حتی اگر به برداشت پول نیاز نداشته باشی؟ جبران زیان تضمین‌شده نیست.","prompt_fr":"Pour un portefeuille diversifié prévu pour au moins cinq ans, quelle baisse deviendrait émotionnellement trop importante, même sans besoin de retirer l’argent ? Le redressement n’est pas garanti.","question_id":"RT04","question_type":"single_choice","score_direction":"direct","scoring":{"A":0,"B":33,"C":67,"D":100},"section":"risk_tolerance","sort_order":7,"version":"v1.10-cognitive-candidate","weight":"1"},{"active":true,"construct":"uncertainty_volatility","construct_role":"facet","options":[{"label":"A lot","value":"A"},{"label":"Somewhat","value":"B"},{"label":"A little","value":"C"},{"label":"Not at all","value":"D"}],"options_fa":[{"label":"خیلی زیاد","value":"A"},{"label":"تا حدی","value":"B"},{"label":"کمی","value":"C"},{"label":"اصلاً","value":"D"}],"options_fr":[{"label":"Beaucoup","value":"A"},{"label":"Assez","value":"B"},{"label":"Un peu","value":"C"},{"label":"Pas du tout","value":"D"}],"prompt_en":"If you knew you would not need the money for at least five years, how much would short-term price uncertainty bother you?","prompt_fa":"اگر بدانی دست‌کم تا پنج سال به این پول نیاز نداری، نامطمئن بودن قیمت‌ها در کوتاه‌مدت چقدر آزارت می‌دهد؟","prompt_fr":"Si vous saviez que vous n’auriez pas besoin de cet argent pendant au moins cinq ans, à quel point l’incertitude des prix à court terme vous dérangerait-elle ?","question_id":"RT06","question_type":"single_choice","score_direction":"direct","scoring":{"A":0,"B":33,"C":67,"D":100},"section":"risk_tolerance","sort_order":8,"version":"v1.10-cognitive-candidate","weight":"1"},{"active":true,"construct":"risk_emotion","construct_role":"consistency","options":[{"label":"Very strongly","value":"A"},{"label":"Fairly strongly","value":"B"},{"label":"Slightly","value":"C"},{"label":"Little or not at all","value":"D"}],"options_fa":[{"label":"خیلی زیاد","value":"A"},{"label":"نسبتاً زیاد","value":"B"},{"label":"کمی","value":"C"},{"label":"خیلی کم یا اصلاً","value":"D"}],"options_fr":[{"label":"Très fortement","value":"A"},{"label":"Assez fortement","value":"B"},{"label":"Légèrement","value":"C"},{"label":"Très peu ou pas du tout","value":"D"}],"prompt_en":"When you think about holding investments that may lose value, how strongly do you prefer to avoid that feeling of uncertainty, even if doing so reduces your potential growth?","prompt_fa":"وقتی به سرمایه‌گذاری‌ای فکر می‌کنی که ممکن است ارزشش کم شود، چقدر ترجیح می‌دهی از حس عدم قطعیت دوری کنی، حتی اگر فرصت رشدت کمتر شود؟","prompt_fr":"Face à un placement pouvant perdre de la valeur, dans quelle mesure préférez-vous éviter ce sentiment d’incertitude, même si cela réduit votre croissance potentielle ?","question_id":"RT08","question_type":"single_choice","score_direction":"direct","scoring":{"A":0,"B":33,"C":67,"D":100},"section":"risk_tolerance","sort_order":9,"version":"v1.10-cognitive-candidate","weight":"1"},{"active":true,"construct":"crash_resilience","construct_role":"consistency","options":[{"label":"Very strong","value":"A"},{"label":"Moderate","value":"B"},{"label":"Slight","value":"C"},{"label":"Little or none","value":"D"}],"options_fa":[{"label":"بسیار زیاد","value":"A"},{"label":"متوسط","value":"B"},{"label":"کم","value":"C"},{"label":"خیلی کم یا هیچ","value":"D"}],"options_fr":[{"label":"Très fort","value":"A"},{"label":"Modéré","value":"B"},{"label":"Léger","value":"C"},{"label":"Faible ou nul","value":"D"}],"prompt_en":"After a major market drop, if your goals and finances were unchanged, how strong would your urge be to lower investment risk?","prompt_fa":"پس از یک افت شدید بازار، اگر هدف‌ها و شرایط مالی‌ات تغییر نکرده باشند، تمایلت به کاهش ریسک سرمایه‌گذاری چقدر خواهد بود؟","prompt_fr":"Après une forte baisse des marchés, si vos objectifs et votre situation financière n’avaient pas changé, à quel point ressentiriez-vous le besoin de réduire le risque de vos placements ?","question_id":"RT10","question_type":"single_choice","score_direction":"direct","scoring":{"A":0,"B":33,"C":67,"D":100},"section":"risk_tolerance","sort_order":10,"version":"v1.10-cognitive-candidate","weight":"1"},{"active":true,"construct":"decision_independence","construct_role":"primary","options":[{"label":"A lot","value":"A"},{"label":"Some","value":"B"},{"label":"A little","value":"C"},{"label":"Not at all","value":"D"}],"options_fa":[{"label":"خیلی زیاد","value":"A"},{"label":"تا حدی","value":"B"},{"label":"کمی","value":"C"},{"label":"اصلاً","value":"D"}],"options_fr":[{"label":"Beaucoup","value":"A"},{"label":"Modérément","value":"B"},{"label":"Un peu","value":"C"},{"label":"Pas du tout","value":"D"}],"prompt_en":"A friend, coworker, or online creator says an investment made them a lot of money. Before checking the details yourself, how much would that success increase your interest in investing?","prompt_fa":"یک دوست، همکار یا تولیدکننده محتوای آنلاین می‌گوید از یک سرمایه‌گذاری سود زیادی گرفته است. پیش از اینکه خودت جزئیات را بررسی کنی، این موفقیت چقدر علاقه‌ات را به آن سرمایه‌گذاری بیشتر می‌کند؟","prompt_fr":"Un ami, un collègue ou un créateur de contenu en ligne dit qu’un placement lui a rapporté beaucoup d’argent. Avant de vérifier vous-même les détails, à quel point ce succès augmenterait-il votre intérêt pour ce placement ?","question_id":"BD01","question_type":"single_choice","score_direction":"direct","scoring":{"A":0,"B":33,"C":67,"D":100},"section":"behavioral_dna","sort_order":11,"version":"v1.10-cognitive-candidate","weight":"1"},{"active":true,"construct":"long_term_orientation","construct_role":"primary","options":[{"label":"A lot","value":"A"},{"label":"Some","value":"B"},{"label":"A little","value":"C"},{"label":"Not at all","value":"D"}],"options_fa":[{"label":"خیلی زیاد","value":"A"},{"label":"تا حدی","value":"B"},{"label":"کمی","value":"C"},{"label":"اصلاً","value":"D"}],"options_fr":[{"label":"Beaucoup","value":"A"},{"label":"Modérément","value":"B"},{"label":"Un peu","value":"C"},{"label":"Pas du tout","value":"D"}],"prompt_en":"An investment rose about 40% last year, but its future outlook has not changed. How much would that gain increase your interest in buying it?","prompt_fa":"یک سرمایه‌گذاری سال گذشته حدود ۴۰٪ رشد کرده، اما چشم‌انداز آینده‌اش تغییری نکرده است. این رشد چقدر علاقه‌ات را به خرید آن بیشتر می‌کند؟","prompt_fr":"Un placement a gagné environ 40 % l’an dernier, mais ses perspectives futures n’ont pas changé. À quel point ce gain augmenterait-il votre intérêt à l’acheter ?","question_id":"BD03","question_type":"single_choice","score_direction":"direct","scoring":{"A":0,"B":33,"C":67,"D":100},"section":"behavioral_dna","sort_order":12,"version":"v1.10-cognitive-candidate","weight":"1"},{"active":true,"construct":"reference_flexibility","construct_role":"primary","options":[{"label":"A lot","value":"A"},{"label":"Some","value":"B"},{"label":"A little","value":"C"},{"label":"Not at all","value":"D"}],"options_fa":[{"label":"زیاد","value":"A"},{"label":"تا حدی","value":"B"},{"label":"کمی","value":"C"},{"label":"اصلاً","value":"D"}],"options_fr":[{"label":"Beaucoup","value":"A"},{"label":"Dans une certaine mesure","value":"B"},{"label":"Un peu","value":"C"},{"label":"Pas du tout","value":"D"}],"prompt_en":"You paid $100 for an investment. It is now worth $60, and its prospects have worsened. When deciding what to do next, how much would the price you originally paid influence you?","prompt_fa":"سرمایه‌گذاری‌ای را ۱۰۰ دلار خریده‌ای. اکنون ۶۰ دلار می‌ارزد و چشم‌اندازش ضعیف‌تر شده است. قیمت خرید اولیه چقدر بر تصمیم بعدی تو اثر می‌گذارد؟","prompt_fr":"Vous avez payé un placement 100 $. Il vaut maintenant 60 $ et ses perspectives se sont affaiblies. Dans quelle mesure le prix payé influencerait-il votre décision ?","question_id":"BD05","question_type":"single_choice","score_direction":"direct","scoring":{"A":0,"B":33,"C":67,"D":100},"section":"behavioral_dna","sort_order":13,"version":"v1.10-cognitive-candidate","weight":"1"},{"active":true,"construct":"evidence_discipline","construct_role":"primary","options":[{"label":"Very unlikely","value":"A"},{"label":"Somewhat unlikely","value":"B"},{"label":"Somewhat likely","value":"C"},{"label":"Very likely","value":"D"}],"options_fa":[{"label":"بسیار بعید","value":"A"},{"label":"نسبتاً بعید","value":"B"},{"label":"نسبتاً محتمل","value":"C"},{"label":"بسیار محتمل","value":"D"}],"options_fr":[{"label":"Très peu probable","value":"A"},{"label":"Peu probable","value":"B"},{"label":"Assez probable","value":"C"},{"label":"Très probable","value":"D"}],"prompt_en":"If credible new evidence challenged an investment idea you felt strongly about, how likely would you be to seriously reconsider your view?","prompt_fa":"اگر اطلاعات جدید و معتبری با یک ایده سرمایه‌گذاری که به آن خیلی باور داری در تضاد باشد، چقدر احتمال دارد دیدگاهت را جدی دوباره بررسی کنی؟","prompt_fr":"Si de nouvelles informations crédibles remettaient en question une idée de placement à laquelle vous croyez fortement, quelle serait la probabilité que vous réexaminiez sérieusement votre opinion ?","question_id":"BD07","question_type":"single_choice","score_direction":"direct","scoring":{"A":0,"B":33,"C":67,"D":100},"section":"behavioral_dna","sort_order":14,"version":"v1.10-cognitive-candidate","weight":"1"},{"active":true,"construct":"emotional_decision_control","construct_role":"primary","options":[{"label":"Very strong","value":"A"},{"label":"Moderate","value":"B"},{"label":"Slight","value":"C"},{"label":"Little or none","value":"D"}],"options_fa":[{"label":"بسیار زیاد","value":"A"},{"label":"متوسط","value":"B"},{"label":"کم","value":"C"},{"label":"خیلی کم یا هیچ",