ort_order":16,"version":"v1.10-cognitive-candidate","weight":"1"},{"active":true,"construct":"long_term_orientation","construct_role":"consistency","options":[{"label":"A lot","value":"A"},{"label":"Some","value":"B"},{"label":"A little","value":"C"},{"label":"Not at all","value":"D"}],"options_fa":[{"label":"خیلی زیاد","value":"A"},{"label":"تا حدی","value":"B"},{"label":"کمی","value":"C"},{"label":"اصلاً","value":"D"}],"options_fr":[{"label":"Beaucoup","value":"A"},{"label":"Modérément","value":"B"},{"label":"Un peu","value":"C"},{"label":"Pas du tout","value":"D"}],"prompt_en":"An investment has lagged the market for 18 months, but your original reasons for owning it still hold. How much would the underperformance alone make you want to sell?","prompt_fa":"یک سرمایه‌گذاری طی ۱۸ ماه از بازار عقب‌تر بوده، اما دلایل اصلی‌ات برای نگه‌داشتن آن هنوز معتبرند. فقط همین عملکرد ضعیف‌تر چقدر تو را به فروش آن متمایل می‌کند؟","prompt_fr":"Un placement a moins bien performé que le marché pendant 18 mois, mais les raisons initiales pour lesquelles vous le détenez sont toujours valables. À quel point cette sous-performance, à elle seule, vous donnerait-elle envie de vendre ?","question_id":"BD04","question_type":"single_choice","score_direction":"direct","scoring":{"A":0,"B":33,"C":67,"D":100},"section":"behavioral_dna","sort_order":17,"version":"v1.10-cognitive-candidate","weight":"1"},{"active":true,"construct":"reference_flexibility","construct_role":"consistency","options":[{"label":"A lot","value":"A"},{"label":"Some","value":"B"},{"label":"A little","value":"C"},{"label":"Not at all","value":"D"}],"options_fa":[{"label":"زیاد","value":"A"},{"label":"تا حدی","value":"B"},{"label":"کمی","value":"C"},{"label":"اصلاً","value":"D"}],"options_fr":[{"label":"Beaucoup","value":"A"},{"label":"Dans une certaine mesure","value":"B"},{"label":"Un peu","value":"C"},{"label":"Pas du tout","value":"D"}],"prompt_en":"You paid $100 for an investment and it is now worth $140. When deciding whether to keep it, how much would the original $100 price influence you, apart from any tax or transaction costs?","prompt_fa":"سرمایه‌گذاری‌ای را ۱۰۰ دلار خریده‌ای و اکنون ۱۴۰ دلار می‌ارزد. جدا از مالیات و هزینهٔ معامله، قیمت خرید اولیه چقدر بر تصمیم نگه‌داشتن آن اثر می‌گذارد؟","prompt_fr":"Vous avez payé un placement 100 $ et il vaut maintenant 140 $. Hors impôts et frais de transaction, dans quelle mesure le prix payé influencerait-il votre décision de le conserver ?","question_id":"BD06","question_type":"single_choice","score_direction":"direct","scoring":{"A":0,"B":33,"C":67,"D":100},"section":"behavioral_dna","sort_order":18,"version":"v1.10-cognitive-candidate","weight":"1"},{"active":true,"construct":"evidence_discipline","construct_role":"consistency","options":[{"label":"Rarely or never","value":"A"},{"label":"Sometimes","value":"B"},{"label":"Often","value":"C"},{"label":"Almost always","value":"D"}],"options_fa":[{"label":"به‌ندرت یا هرگز","value":"A"},{"label":"گاهی","value":"B"},{"label":"اغلب","value":"C"},{"label":"تقریباً همیشه","value":"D"}],"options_fr":[{"label":"Rarement ou jamais","value":"A"},{"label":"Parfois","value":"B"},{"label":"Souvent","value":"C"},{"label":"Presque toujours","value":"D"}],"prompt_en":"When you like an investment idea, how often do you actively look for information that could prove you wrong before investing?","prompt_fa":"وقتی از یک ایده سرمایه‌گذاری خوشت می‌آید، پیش از سرمایه‌گذاری چند وقت یک‌بار فعالانه دنبال اطلاعاتی می‌گردی که ممکن است نشان دهد نظرت اشتباه است؟","prompt_fr":"Lorsque vous aimez une idée de placement, à quelle fréquence cherchez-vous activement, avant d’investir, des informations qui pourraient montrer que vous avez tort ?","question_id":"BD08","question_type":"single_choice","score_direction":"direct","scoring":{"A":0,"B":33,"C":67,"D":100},"section":"behavioral_dna","sort_order":19,"version":"v1.10-cognitive-candidate","weight":"1"},{"active":true,"construct":"emotional_decision_control","construct_role":"facet","options":[{"label":"A lot","value":"A"},{"label":"Some","value":"B"},{"label":"A little","value":"C"},{"label":"Not at all","value":"D"}],"options_fa":[{"label":"خیلی زیاد","value":"A"},{"label":"تا حدی","value":"B"},{"label":"کمی","value":"C"},{"label":"اصلاً","value":"D"}],"options_fr":[{"label":"Beaucoup","value":"A"},{"label":"Modérément","value":"B"},{"label":"Un peu","value":"C"},{"label":"Pas du tout","value":"D"}],"prompt_en":"If you sold an investment and it later rose a lot, how much would that regret affect your next investment decision?","prompt_fa":"اگر یک سرمایه‌گذاری را بفروشی و بعد قیمتش خیلی بالا برود، حس پشیمانی چقدر روی تصمیم سرمایه‌گذاری بعدی‌ات اثر می‌گذارد؟","prompt_fr":"Si vous vendiez un placement et qu’il montait ensuite fortement, à quel point le regret que vous ressentiriez influencerait-il votre prochaine décision de placement ?","question_id":"BD10","question_type":"single_choice","score_direction":"direct","scoring":{"A":0,"B":33,"C":67,"D":100},"section":"behavioral_dna","sort_order":20,"version":"v1.10-cognitive-candidate","weight":"1"},{"active":true,"construct":"financial_buffer","construct_role":"primary","options":[{"label":"Nothing is left, or expenses exceed income","value":"A"},{"label":"More than 0% but less than 10%","value":"B"},{"label":"10% to 20%","value":"C"},{"label":"More than 20%","value":"D"}],"options_fa":[{"label":"چیزی باقی نمی‌ماند یا هزینه‌ها بیشتر از درآمد است","value":"A"},{"label":"بیش از صفر و کمتر از ۱۰٪","value":"B"},{"label":"از ۱۰٪ تا ۲۰٪","value":"C"},{"label":"بیشتر از ۲۰٪","value":"D"}],"options_fr":[{"label":"Rien, ou les dépenses dépassent le revenu","value":"A"},{"label":"Plus de 0 %, mais moins de 10 %","value":"B"},{"label":"De 10 % à 20 %","value":"C"},{"label":"Plus de 20 %","value":"D"}],"prompt_en":"After essential household costs and required debt payments, what share of the household's regular after-tax income is usually left? Include pension or other regular income.","prompt_fa":"پس از مخارج ضروری خانوار و اقساط لازم، معمولاً چه سهمی از درآمد منظم خانوار پس از مالیات باقی می‌ماند؟ مستمری یا سایر درآمدهای منظم را هم حساب کن.","prompt_fr":"Après les dépenses essentielles du ménage et les remboursements obligatoires, quelle part du revenu régulier après impôt reste habituellement ? Incluez les pensions et autres revenus réguliers.","question_id":"RC01","question_type":"single_choice","score_direction":"direct","scoring":{"A":0,"B":33,"C":67,"D":100},"section":"risk_capacity","sort_order":21,"version":"v1.10-cognitive-candidate","weight":"1"},{"active":true,"construct":"income_stability","construct_role":"primary","options":[{"label":"Very uncertain or highly variable","value":"A"},{"label":"Somewhat uncertain or variable","value":"B"},{"label":"Mostly predictable","value":"C"},{"label":"Very predictable","value":"D"}],"options_fa":[{"label":"بسیار نامطمئن یا بسیار متغیر","value":"A"},{"label":"تا حدی نامطمئن یا متغیر","value":"B"},{"label":"عمدتاً قابل پیش‌بینی","value":"C"},{"label":"بسیار قابل پیش‌بینی","value":"D"}],"options_fr":[{"label":"Très incertain ou très variable","value":"A"},{"label":"Assez incertain ou variable","value":"B"},{"label":"Plutôt prévisible","value":"C"},{"label":"Très prévisible","value":"D"}],"prompt_en":"How predictable is the income you rely on for essential living costs over the next 12 months?","prompt_fa":"درآمدی که برای هزینه‌های ضروری زندگی در ۱۲ ماه آینده روی آن حساب می‌کنی چقدر قابل پیش‌بینی است؟","prompt_fr":"À quel point le revenu sur lequel vous comptez pour vos dépenses essentielles au cours des 12 prochains mois est-il prévisible ?","question_id":"RC02","question_type":"single_choice","score_direction":"direct","scoring":{"A":0,"B":33,"C":67,"D":100},"section":"risk_capacity","sort_order":22,"version":"v1.10-cognitive-candidate","weight":"1"},{"active":true,"construct":"emergency_reserve","construct_role":"primary","options":[{"label":"Less than 1 month","value":"A"},{"label":"At least 1 month but less than 3 months","value":"B"},{"label":"At least 3 months but no more than 6 months","value":"C"},{"label":"More than 6 months","value":"D"}],"options_fa":[{"label":"کمتر از یک ماه","value":"A"},{"label":"از یک ماه تا کمتر از سه ماه","value":"B"},{"label":"از سه ماه تا شش ماه","value":"C"},{"label":"بیش از شش ماه","value":"D"}],"options_fr":[{"label":"Moins d’un mois","value":"A"},{"label":"Au moins un mois, mais moins de trois mois","value":"B"},{"label":"De trois à six mois","value":"C"},{"label":"Plus de six mois","value":"D"}],"prompt_en":"Without borrowing or selling the investments being assessed, how long could money set aside for emergencies cover essential household expenses if regular income stopped?","prompt_fa":"بدون قرض‌گرفتن یا فروش سرمایه‌گذاری‌های مورد ارزیابی، اگر درآمد منظم قطع شود، پول کنارگذاشته‌شده برای شرایط اضطراری تا چه مدت مخارج ضروری خانوار را پوشش می‌دهد؟","prompt_fr":"Sans emprunter ni vendre les placements évalués, combien de temps l’épargne d’urgence couvrirait-elle les dépenses essentielles du ménage si le revenu régulier cessait ?","question_id":"RC03","question_type":"single_choice","score_direction":"direct","scoring":{"A":0,"B":33,"C":67,"D":100},"section":"risk_capacity","sort_order":23,"version":"v1.10-cognitive-candidate","weight":"1"},{"active":true,"construct":"financial_responsibility","construct_role":"primary","options":[{"label":"They leave us struggling to cover essential costs","value":"A"},{"label":"They leave little room for unexpected costs","value":"B"},{"label":"They are manageable with some room for unexpected costs","value":"C"},{"label":"They are comfortably covered, or we have no such commitments","value":"D"}],"options_fa":[{"label":"برای پوشش هزینه‌های ضروری مشکل ایجاد می‌کنند","value":"A"},{"label":"جای کمی برای هزینهٔ غیرمنتظره می‌گذارند","value":"B"},{"label":"قابل‌مدیریت‌اند و کمی جای هزینهٔ غیرمنتظره باقی می‌گذارند","value":"C"},{"label":"به‌راحتی پوشش داده می‌شوند یا چنین تعهدی نداریم","value":"D"}],"options_fr":[{"label":"Ils rendent difficiles les dépenses essentielles","value":"A"},{"label":"Ils laissent peu de marge pour les imprévus","value":"B"},{"label":"Ils sont gérables avec une certaine marge pour les imprévus","value":"C"},{"label":"Ils sont couverts facilement, ou nous n’en avons pas","value":"D"}],"prompt_en":"How much pressure do required debt payments or essential financial commitments that are not already funded put on your household finances?","prompt_fa":"اقساط لازم یا تعهدات مالی ضروری که پولشان از قبل تأمین نشده، چقدر به وضعیت مالی خانوارت فشار می‌آورند؟","prompt_fr":"Quelle pression les remboursements obligatoires ou engagements financiers essentiels non encore financés exercent-ils sur les finances de votre ménage ?","question_id":"RC04","question_type":"single_choice","score_direction":"direct","scoring":{"A":0,"B":33,"C":67,"D":100},"section":"risk_capacity","sort_order":24,"version":"v1.10-cognitive-candidate","weight":"1"},{"active":true,"construct":"loss_impact","construct_role":"primary","options":[{"label":"Definitely yes","value":"A"},{"label":"Probably yes","value":"B"},{"label":"Probably no","value":"C"},{"label":"Definitely no","value":"D"}],"options_fa":[{"label":"قطعاً بله","value":"A"},{"label":"احتمالاً بله","value":"B"},{"label":"احتمالاً نه","value":"C"},{"label":"قطعاً نه","value":"D"}],"options_fr":[{"label":"Certainement oui","value":"A"},{"label":"Probablement oui","value":"B"},{"label":"Probablement non","value":"C"},{"label":"Certainement non","value":"D"}],"prompt_en":"If the investments being assessed lost 20% and did not recover before the money was needed, would your household have to cut essential spending or miss an important financial commitment?","prompt_fa":"اگر سرمایه‌گذاری‌های مورد ارزیابی ۲۰٪ افت کنند و تا زمان نیاز به پول جبران نشوند، آیا خانوارت مجبور می‌شود خرج ضروری را کاهش دهد یا تعهد مهمی را انجام ندهد؟","prompt_fr":"Si les placements évalués perdaient 20 % sans se redresser avant que vous ayez besoin de l’argent, votre ménage devrait-il réduire ses dépenses essentielles ou manquer un engagement important ?","question_id":"RC05","question_type":"single_choice","score_direction":"direct","scoring":{"A":0,"B":33,"C":67,"D":100},"section":"risk_capacity","sort_order":25,"version":"v1.10-cognitive-candidate","weight":"1"},{"active":true,"construct":"decision_experience","construct_role":"context","options":[{"label":"I have not invested before","value":"A"},{"label":"Less than 2 years","value":"B"},{"label":"2–5 years","value":"C"},{"label":"More than 5 years","value":"D"}],"options_fa":[{"label":"تا حالا سرمایه‌گذاری نکرده‌ام","value":"A"},{"label":"کمتر از ۲ سال","value":"B"},{"label":"۲ تا ۵ سال","value":"C"},{"label":"بیشتر از ۵ سال","value":"D"}],"options_fr":[{"label":"Je n’ai jamais investi auparavant","value":"A"},{"label":"Moins de 2 ans","value":"B"},{"label":"2 à 5 ans","value":"C"},{"label":"Plus de 5 ans","value":"D"}],"prompt_en":"How long have you personally been making investment decisions with your own money?","prompt_fa":"چه مدت است که شخصاً با پول خودت درباره سرمایه‌گذاری تصمیم می‌گیری؟","prompt_fr":"Depuis combien de temps prenez-vous personnellement des décisions de placement avec votre propre argent ?","question_id":"EX01","question_type":"single_choice","score_direction":"direct","scoring":{"A":0,"B":1,"C":2,"D":3},"section":"investment_experience","sort_order":26,"version":"v1.10-cognitive-candidate","weight":"1"},{"active":true,"construct":"product_exposure","construct_role":"context","options":[{"label":"I have not invested before","value":"none"},{"label":"Cash, savings, or GICs","value":"cash"},{"label":"Mutual funds or unleveraged ETFs","value":"funds"},{"label":"Individual stocks","value":"stocks"},{"label":"Individual bonds","value":"bonds"},{"label":"Options, leveraged funds, or other complex products","value":"complex"}],"options_fa":[{"label":"قبلاً سرمایه‌گذاری نکرده‌ام","value":"none"},{"label":"پول نقد، پس‌انداز یا گواهی سپرده تضمینی (GIC)","value":"cash"},{"label":"صندوق‌های مشترک یا ETF بدون اهرم","value":"funds"},{"label":"سهام شرکت‌ها به‌صورت مستقیم","value":"stocks"},{"label":"اوراق بدهی به‌صورت مستقیم","value":"bonds"},{"label":"اختیار معامله، صندوق اهرمی یا محصولات پیچیدهٔ دیگر","value":"complex"}],"options_fr":[{"label":"Je n’ai jamais investi","value":"none"},{"label":"Liquidités, épargne ou CPG","value":"cash"},{"label":"Fonds communs ou FNB sans levier","value":"funds"},{"label":"Actions individuelles","value":"stocks"},{"label":"Obligations individuelles","value":"bonds"},{"label":"Options, fonds à effet de levier ou autres produits complexes","value":"complex"}],"prompt_en":"Which types of investments have you personally owned and followed? Select all that apply.","prompt_fa":"کدام نوع سرمایه‌گذاری‌ها را شخصاً داشته‌ای و پیگیری کرده‌ای؟ همهٔ موارد مرتبط را انتخاب کن.","prompt_fr":"Quels types de placements avez-vous personnellement détenus et suivis ? Sélectionnez toutes les réponses pertinentes.","question_id":"EX02","question_type":"multi_choice","score_direction":"direct","scoring":{},"section":"investment_experience","sort_order":27,"version":"v1.10-cognitive-candidate","weight":"1"},{"active":true,"construct":"downturn_experience","construct_role":"context","options":[{"label":"No","value":"A"},{"label":"I saw one happen, but had little money invested","value":"B"},{"label":"Yes, once","value":"C"},{"label":"Yes, more than once","value":"D"}],"options_fa":[{"label":"نه","value":"A"},{"label":"چنین افتی را دیده‌ام، اما پول کمی سرمایه‌گذاری کرده بودم","value":"B"},{"label":"بله، یک بار","value":"C"},{"label":"بله، بیش از یک بار","value":"D"}],"options_fr":[{"label":"Non","value":"A"},{"label":"J’en ai vu une, mais j’avais peu d’argent investi","value":"B"},{"label":"Oui, une fois","value":"C"},{"label":"Oui, plus d’une fois","value":"D"}],"prompt_en":"Have you had a meaningful amount of your own money invested during a broad market decline of about 20% or more?","prompt_fa":"آیا تا به حال هنگام یک افت گسترده بازار در حدود ۲۰٪ یا بیشتر، مقدار قابل توجهی از پول خودت در بازار سرمایه‌گذاری بوده است؟","prompt_fr":"Avez-vous déjà eu une somme importante de votre propre argent investie pendant une baisse généralisée des marchés d’environ 20 % ou plus ?","question_id":"EX03","question_type":"single_choice","score_direction":"direct","scoring":{"A":0,"B":1,"C":2,"D":3},"section":"investment_experience","sort_order":28,"version":"v1.10-cognitive-candidate","weight":"1"}]$questions$::jsonb);
